{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh no!!</i><br>Your sweet caring grandmama has been kidnapped by the villain Heimgartner!<br>It is up to you, as the young wood golem Linden, to set things right again!<br><br>- How can a golem have a grandmother?<br>- Who are these villains doing such terrible things?<br>- And what is up with that quirky floating skull following you, called &quot;Murray&quot;?<br><br>All will be revealed in the full game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Zelda-like gameplay with fresh twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 large interconnected worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 massive, themed dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 100+ distinct enemy types and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Countless secrets hidden everywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-linear level and world design, for optional sequence breaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modern conveniences, like auto-saving, map markers and button remapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A quirky companion: Murray!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE the world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark</strong> upon a new adventure, heavily inspired by the classic 2D Zelda's - with a unique story, world and various twists on familiar tropes, enemies and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow</strong> the path, or <strong>explore</strong> the non-linear design for even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/41800770f79a9c1eef77f80059e710a1.poster.avif?t=1772711400\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/41800770f79a9c1eef77f80059e710a1.webm?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/41800770f79a9c1eef77f80059e710a1.mp4?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER secrets everywhere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push</strong> statues, blow up walls, look for hidden switches and so much more. This game will keep you on your toes throughout, with it's <strong>large variety</strong> of <strong>handcrafted</strong> puzzles and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/f14a7e9fb96a9cfcc1efc2d8d8bec62f.poster.avif?t=1772711400\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/f14a7e9fb96a9cfcc1efc2d8d8bec62f.webm?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/f14a7e9fb96a9cfcc1efc2d8d8bec62f.mp4?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> all the classic <strong>items and gear</strong> you might expect from a journey like this. Along with a few new ones to make you even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And meet quirky NPC's who can <strong>awaken</strong> your equipment even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/15f924af75c287ac75d872df9e93d482.poster.avif?t=1772711400\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/15f924af75c287ac75d872df9e93d482.webm?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/15f924af75c287ac75d872df9e93d482.mp4?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek out</strong> the <strong>rich lore</strong> scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world where all the elements, plants and creatures are formed from magical sprites. Where the dungeons have history. And the villains have deeper goals and motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERCOME new challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> through intricately designed dungeons using combat, navigational skills and spacial awareness. And get ready for some real mind-bending puzzle box designs in the later dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/1bbe68efd5dae6dc11cda6346db880ca.avif?t=1772711400\" width=600 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> a wide range of enemies, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. Your trusted sword is rarely the fastest path to victory. <strong>Experiment</strong> with Linden's full arsenal to find their real weaknesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/7a5cd997ab9c1dfabb941fcb6a290300.poster.avif?t=1772711400\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/7a5cd997ab9c1dfabb941fcb6a290300.webm?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/extras/7a5cd997ab9c1dfabb941fcb6a290300.mp4?t=1772711400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome</strong> massive deadly bosses. Each one is unique, with their own style, mechanics and weaknesses to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST TODAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to be among the first to discover this brand new world of dungeons, secrets and adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATE\u00a0March 5th, 2026:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is constant progress being made: The soundtrack is basically done, the 5th dungeon is getting close to completion, and development just started on the 89th distinct enemy type.    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2738140?t=1772711400","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2738140?t=1772711400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/8e43e44fcf9da5b0ce561f28c5389bd261c9e841/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772711400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738140/8e43e44fcf9da5b0ce561f28c5389bd261c9e841/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772711400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2811380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"